abstract: >-
  Simulation framework for a physics-informed digital twin of a three-phase
  substation transformer: IEC 60076-7 thermal modeling, PINN hot-spot
  estimation benchmarked against Kalman-filter and gray-box estimators,
  knowledge-distilled edge inference with repeated cross-validation, and
  remaining-useful-life estimation. Revision R1 of IEEE Access manuscript
  Access-2026-53764.
